mies behind them (scales with hero level). Each Basic Attack hit reduces the cooldowns of Abyss Walker by 0.8s and Spear of Misery by 0.8s.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_598dfa238e4987c45419783b299aa4fc.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":3110,"name":"Abyss Walker","description":"Moskov teleports to the target location, increasing his Attack Speed to 1.15 times for 3s. Meanwhile, his Basic Attack deals  (+10% Total Physical Attack) more damage to enemies behind the primary target.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ad0a57328e772be2fa70550692507a86.png","video":null,"cd":10.0,"cost":50.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"},{"name":"Buff","rgb":"79,156,184"}]},{"id":3120,"name":"Spear of Misery","description":"Moskov launches a powerful strike at the target enemy hero or Creep, dealing 300 (+60% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage, knocking them back, and revealing their position for 2s.\n\nIf the target collides with an enemy hero when knocked back, they'll both take 200 (+30% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and be stunned for 1.2s. If the enemy is knocked into a wall, they will also be stunned for the same duration.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_108c7b9f3ac11309bbcdf0bf1b185d46.png","video":null,"cd":12.0,"cost":90.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"CC","rgb":"205,93,109"},{"name":"Damage","rgb":"199,121,85"}]},{"id":3130,"name":"Spear of Destruction","description":"After a short delay, Moskov throws the Spear of Destruction in the target direction, dealing 340 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in its path and to the first enemy hero hit. Upon hitting an enemy hero, the spear pierces them, dealing 10% extra Physical Damage to enemies behind them. The target and enemies hit by the piercing damage will be slowed by 50% for 1s (the slow duration scales with the spear's travel time, up to 3s).\n\nWhen Spear of Destruction hits the first enemy hero, it creates a shadow behind them and refreshes the cooldown of Abyss Walker.\n\nUse Again: Moskov casts Abyss Walker from the shadow's location (shares the same cooldown as the skill).","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f51734d9a49d298d05e1dc81d8e740c2.png","video":null,"cd":55.0,"cost":130.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Slow","rgb":"205,93,109"},{"name":"Teleport","rgb":"162,105,198"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Moskov works well with heroes like Atlas and Gatotkaca who can CC groups of enemies so he can focus on maximizing the damage of his piercing AOE.","heroes":[{"id":117,"name":"Fredrinn","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_dea170bfd5f26c41fb04e5edf72afedb.png"},{"id":41,"name":"Gatotkaca","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_96f9dbbc096e0f0a28f9b9e587d06a9c.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Moskov's 1st Skill provides a blink effect, making him a threat to fighters with poor mobility like Thamuz and Balmond.","heroes":[{"id":72,"name":"Thamuz","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b5ad55e408b68acf6a86e7ff76f5f569.png"},{"id":2,"name":"Balmond","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_df9a6990b1946d045e4d3a46c90725cf.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Moskov is countered by heroes with high mobility, such as Lancelot and Natalia, who can quickly close the gap and take him out.","heroes":[{"id":47,"name":"Lancelot","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_dc4b821e49b904715172136017798da3.png"},{"id":24,"name":"Natalia","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_123